{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-2", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "浮浮沉沉", "storyInfo": "招摇撞骗的假贵族德·托莱多在同伴瓦列里奥的推荐下进入船厂工作。阿奎拉在人群中进行非法交易被德鲁莎逮捕。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "天，你不是在广场跟审判庭对着干的那个姑娘吗，怎么到船厂门口来了？埃娅，科隆·德，托多……叫什么来着？", "name": "洒脱的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是埃斯特菲尼娅·科隆·德·托莱多！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这几天在哪儿都能见到你，到处宣讲黄金时代的故事，难道你真的是王室海军的后裔？", "name": "洒脱的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 19, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那还有假——", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#4$1"}, {"id": 21, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚所有的贵族和我们的黄金时代都已经死去，每一位教士、每一部经书都这么说。", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萨尔瓦多……", "name": "洒脱的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然你认为它们已经死去，现在又为什么站在这里，参与打捞呢？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“圣徒在上，我愿遵循伊比利亚美德的化身的指引。”", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“祈祷诸位能驱使审判的灯火，洗涤我们的戴罪之身，祛除因罪而滋生的孽物。”", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我该为接触你等罪孽的化身感到羞耻，我的盐呢……我该警醒自己……", "name": "萨尔瓦多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2274_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以你对我们充满荣光的过去，甚至对雷亚-伊比利亚长什么样子都没有期待吗？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#8$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "何其可悲，你老家的教士到底叫你抄了多少遍经？审判庭的经书本就——", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等再跟他们攀谈吧，审判庭调查，麻烦跟我走一趟。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loading_intro", "key": "$loading_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是你？启动仪式当天你就拦我，怎么今天又找到我头上！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "满口谎言，煽动群众……我怀疑你另有所图，但这里是港都外围城区，我不会直接逮捕你，只希望你能配合接受身份调查。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#8$1"}, {"id": 49, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "长官，请等一等……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想您看得出来，装作贵族只是因为她想谋财，那些黄金时代的故事也只是为了吸引眼球而夸大其词……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果她真如你所说只是谋财，不曾与异端勾结，只要受讯结束就能被释放。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请谅解，一切为了伊比利亚的洁净与德行。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#1$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可你维护它们的方式并不是审判庭所期许的，南多·加西亚·鲁比奥。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_fsmummy", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "斐戴拉大审判官？", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#10$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为什么在船厂门前生事？你的教官是谁，巡逻组的工作需要我再重复一遍吗？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "与德鲁莎教官无关，是我自己发现了异常，想进一步追查。", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#11$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "调查批文呢？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没有……", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#11$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "连巧立名目都不会，该说你是诚实还是愚钝。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抬起头，士兵，回到你的岗位上去。我不会捆住你的手脚，但下次行动前，你需要好好想清楚，自己究竟是为何行动。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2269_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是……", "name": "南多"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2269_1#7$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "loop": "true", "channel": "4"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "4", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_fsmummy", "loop": "true", "channel": "5"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "5", "fadetime": 1.5}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "duration": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "loop": "true", "channel": "r"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "r", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "duration": 1.0, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "200,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刚刚多谢您，大审判官阁下。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我没有为你们辩护。", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她依然是个欺诈之徒，你们公然到船厂门前宣讲已经扰乱了船厂的秩序。", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不把她带回去，还留在这里干什么？", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我就是为了这件事想找您帮忙……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$warm_intro", "key": "$warm_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭的人竟然真的放过你了？", "name": "洒脱的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呼——我、我早就跟你们说过，我可是王室海军后裔，只要成为我的拥护者，我也能庇护你们。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#3$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "拥护……怎么拥护？", "name": "洒脱的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一心想要重新组建王室海军舰队，现在还在漫漫征途之中。只不过，筹备舰队需要资金……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "百年以前，领民确实需要向贵族缴纳税金，可现在我们没这么多钱……", "name": "洒脱的船工"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2275_1#1$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用非得是钱，哪怕是一餐饭、一个住所都好。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1"}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等雷亚-伊比利亚打捞完成，我们的舰队从港口正式出航，到时候我们说不定还能骗得……咳，获得更多财富呢！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 138, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我跟她相识数月，她一直靠骗人、讲故事维生。我受过重伤，没有务工能力，没有她接济怕是早就饿死了。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "话虽如此，我也不能看着一个年轻人一再犯错。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她的记性很好，也很乐于跟人打交道，走过的路又多，她的脑子里都快有一张自己画的伊比利亚地图了。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "地图？", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，而且不仅是现在的伊比利亚的地图。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她和那些流离失所的人交谈，记住他们的故事和他们的家乡被海水淹没前的位置。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她所记住的东西里，有伊比利亚本应有的样子。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等到雷亚-伊比利亚中心城区升起，我们或许需要打捞更多沉没的城镇，既然如此……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她会十分适合在船厂工作。", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她很早就被家人抛弃，又出于一些特殊原因没办法从事体力劳动。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果伊比利亚的未来跟即将升起的中心城区一样光明，那她是否也不用再以欺诈为生……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你想要让她生活得更有尊严？", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚人本应具有崇高的德行，这一点也是您所相信的，对吗？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我明白了。", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然你们曾实实在在地干扰了审判庭的事务，但这个城区会再给你们一次机会。", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "来船厂报到吧，我们用得上她。", "name": "斐戴拉"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g3_seasidest_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.4, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "船厂外，人越聚越多，起初人们只是被这里发生的口角和黎博利洪亮的声音吸引，想要一探究竟——"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "却没想到自己会沉迷于一个小姑娘所说的故事。"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那边那个制帆匠，你说自己来自金浪湾的金浪城？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 183, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个终年浓雾笼罩的肮脏小城，城里的教士说城名是罪孽的由来。鳞获不丰，粮食不长，都是名字的错，现在它改名为无浪城啦。", "name": "制帆匠"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜啊，在我祖辈的描述中，那里的建筑都是白色的，因为无需染料，夕阳自会给它们镀金，居民也都是捕鳞的好手。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#12$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，那不是因为他们对鳞群习性多么了解，而是因为他们捕鳞的范围比任何城镇都广。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然每次捕鳞，他们的船只都离岸很远，但他们不怕。因为他们知道，只要在天黑前回望，建筑的金光总能为他们指路。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 190, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "还有这种说法……？", "name": "制帆匠"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然！而且金浪城还诞生过不少因航海和制帆技术高超而封官加爵的能人，听说他们的子嗣依旧留在城中，只是对祖先的身份不自知……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我确实比邻居更擅长针线……难道……", "name": "制帆匠"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正好，德·托莱多大人正在筹备海军舰队，我缺的就是制帆匠，你说巧不巧？说不定我们的祖辈还在王室海军舰队中见过呢！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#11$1"}, {"id": 198, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，好！", "name": "制帆匠"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（做口型）瓦列里奥！瓦列里奥快看！我又找到一个拥护者啦，今天的晚饭有着落啦！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#3$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.2, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天这条街怎么聚集了那么多人？正好，能为我们的行动打掩护。", "name": "谨慎的岛民"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉，你来晚了。早上有你的工作安排吗？怎么看上去像刚下过水。", "name": "谨慎的岛民"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没什么，去处理了一点私事。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "东西送到了？它对几天后的行动很重要。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心吧，惩戒军盯不过来。", "name": "谨慎的岛民"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1", "duration": 0.8, "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "150,0"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "duration": 0.8, "posfrom": "150,0", "posto": "350,0"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "换一条路。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "运输活鳞用的旧管道？那条路只有同胞才知道。", "name": "谨慎的岛民"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "走。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_461_1#1$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_ibindoor", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorclosequite"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_doorknob"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不好。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#11$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "岛民才知道的路也不一定安全啊，毕竟不是所有岛民都是危险分子，不是吗？", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#11$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "duration": 0.3, "bstart": 0.3, "bend": 0.6, "posfrom": "50,0", "posto": "50,0"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_handknf"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 20.0, "ystrength": 20.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘶……", "name": "谨慎的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2273_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,-60", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$bodyfalldown1"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.2, "xstrength": 10.0, "ystrength": 10.0, "vibrato": 10.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又是你！", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我之前真的多余把你当同胞看待。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不也辜负了同胞的心意，那个叫纳乔的孩子，他根本不擅长说谎，你倒是没想过牵连他。", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老实点，你想做什么？", "name": "德鲁莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "把这个带